# Window and command link
error-brg-backend-unknown = ordin was asked to use a service it doesn't know. Restart ordin and try again.
error-brg-closing = ordin is closing, so that couldn't be done.
error-brg-journal-lagged = Some activity wasn't recorded because ordin got behind. Try again.
error-brg-stream-lagging = This window is falling behind, so some updates were skipped.
error-brg-stream-no-window = There is no open window to show that in.
error-brg-window-lagging = This window has stopped keeping up with updates. Reopen it.
